here are some  times we might need to use drones to  trust us we'll just use a woman  guy actually trust share favorite a lot  and I think he's one of the best  sheriffs in the United States okay so I  I feel that way  okay whatever privacy framework we adopt  now will be used as the baseline into  the future not only for Alameda but for  other jurisdictions across the country  we hope that Alameda becomes a leader in  privacy protections not privacy  violations I think their goals are noble  I don't think they're out there to  violate all our rights but if we don't  pay attention that's exactly what can  happen Alameda couldn't decide that day  if they would use drones or not the  debate is still going on there but when  it comes to technology and civil  liberties the debate may never be  settled for recent TV I'm Paul Detrick
 

